Subject: [PATCH v1 0/3] soc: qcom: add SMP2P AP sleep state notifier
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add the SMP2P-based AP sleep-state notifier (and its binding) that the
ADSP sensor framework (SEE) requires to avoid faulting on system suspend,
as used on the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q, SM7125).

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mráz (1):
  dt-bindings: soc: qcom: add SMP2P AP sleep state notifier

Richard Acayan (1):
  dt-bindings: soc: qcom,smp2p: add sleepstate support

miromraz (1):
  soc: qcom: add SMP2P AP sleep state notifier

